{"title":"What should I ask Joe Studwell?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/940031324/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Joe-Studwell.html","date":1768205002000,"content":"<p>He has a new and excellent book coming out, namely <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/How-Africa-Works-author/dp/0802158439/ref=books_amazonstores_desktop_mfs_aufs_ap_sc_dsk_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;pd_rd_w=HJ8Vb&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.6d92b4c0-97d6-4063-b66e-20890dfbd616&amp;pf_rd_p=6d92b4c0-97d6-4063-b66e-20890dfbd616&amp;pf_rd_r=139-7026227-2249935&amp;pd_rd_wg=man3x&amp;pd_rd_r=dac6887e-01f0-439b-a61f-0c4a55ab7703\" target=\"_blank\">How Africa Works: Success and Failure on the World’s Last Developmental Frontier</a>, which I consumed eagerly.  You probably know his earlier book <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/How-Asia-Works-Joe-Studwell/dp/0802121322/ref=sr_1_1?crid=164EP1LMXH4FL&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.hlIr2q8MSPbydfxVa0ERZ8BZ3knR9P0zoQQG7bkSSr7GjHj071QN20LucGBJIEps.DLBwKq8Vrlj6dIpJxQ5MIX45-4Twuf6MX085PKxuGlM&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=joe+studwell+how+asia+works&amp;qid=1768165203&amp;sprefix=joe+studlwe%2Caps%2C142&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">How Asia Works</a>.  So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>For additional context, here is the opening of <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://joestudwell.com/about/\" target=\"_blank\">his home page</a> (no Wikipedia page?):</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>Hello. I am an author, journalist, public speaker and occasional university teacher. I am based much of the time in Cambridge. In the 2000s I restored and lived in a home in a still unspoiled area of central Italy (the photo at the top of the page is a view from the house).</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/what-should-i-ask-joe-studwell.html\">What should I ask Joe Studwell?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/940031324/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/940031324/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/940031324/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/940031324/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/940031324/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/940031324/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/what-should-i-ask-joe-studwell.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/what-should-i-ask-joe-studwell.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/what-should-i-ask-joe-studwell.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/what-should-i-ask-joe-studwell.html#comment-161004748\">Is house renovation emotionally or rationally justified? Both?</a> <i>by Roger Mexico</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/what-should-i-ask-joe-studwell.html#comment-161004746\">Is house renova